                '* **4. Tier 4 — Fiscal, Super-64, 2nd-Generation Dynastic & NDC Clean-Green Harvest Stack (+7.42%% CE Nat.) & Wedges 4 & 5 (`L11` = +2.46%% CE, `L12` = +1.03%% CE):**\n', ...
                '   * *Isolated Factors:* Layer 9 evaluates the **-60 bps** domestic interest rate reduction ($`\\Delta r = -0.006`$, **+1.25%% CE**) from the 50%% Sovereign Debt-Sinking allocation. Layer 10 evaluates the **-3.15 to -3.75 pp** working-age PAYE tax cut ($`\\tau_l: 0.2200 \\to 0.1885\\text{--}0.1825`$, including `-0.64 pp` funded by retiring 85%% of the *SS1* geographic transfer) paired with lowering universal NZ Superannuation to Age 64 ($`\\Phi_{\\mathrm{time}}(64) = 1.081`$, **+2.69%% CE**).\n', ...
                '   * *Wedge 4 (`L11_WEDGE4_Fiscal_TFR_2ndGen_Closure` = +2.46%% CE Nat., 9.86%% Share):* Captures the closed-loop dynastic and demographic fixed point at $`t \\ge 25`$ (`Jump 2` in `T1` row `SS2_3_LongRun_GE_EndoIntergen`).\n', ...
                '   * *Wedge 5 (`L12_WEDGE5_NDC_CleanGreen_Export` = +1.03%% CE Nat., +1.75%% Rural, +1.30%% Small, 4.12%% Share):* Captures the spatial and trade complementarity between front-loaded CERF household/enterprise electrification (`-Inv 5`), circular biogenic methane pricing ($`\\theta_{\\mathrm{ag}}: 0 \\to 1.0`$), and phasing out exotic monoculture pine ETS arbitrage ($`\\kappa_{\\mathrm{pine}}: 1.0 \\to 0.0`$) [Ref 29, 30, 46]—flipping primary-sector producers from `SS0` CBAM drag (`Pi_trade = 0.94`) to a verified **+4.5%% (`Rural`) / +3.0%% (`Small`) Clean-Green export premium** (`Pi_trade = 1.05 / 1.03`) while extinguishing the `NZD 18.5B` offshore Paris NDC liability.\n\n', ...
